Today is my first day at the office.
I am very happy.
I wake up early in the morning.
I drink some tea.
I get ready for the office.
I work in a software company.
I prepare my bag.
I check all my things.
I have my laptop.
I have my ID documents too.
I check my wallet.
I have some rupees.
Then I look at my mobile.
But I do not have a local phone number.
I do not have an Indian SIM.
I close my bag.
Now I am completely ready.
I leave the house.
